{
  "name": "Agency Ad Report Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 AGENCY AD REPORT AUTOMATION\n**What it does:** Every Monday 08:00 → pulls last-7-days performance from Meta Ads, Google Ads, and GA4 → computes totals + ROAS → AI writes a plain-language client summary → branded HTML report emailed to the client + digest posted to the agency's Telegram.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- Meta app + ad account access (developers.facebook.com) — Graph API token\n- Google Ads API access (developers.google.com/google-ads) — developer token + OAuth\n- GA4 Data API access (developers.google.com/analytics) — service account or OAuth\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets + Gmail OAuth2 credentials, one log sheet\n- Telegram bot token + chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n\n**All secrets are PASTE_YOUR_* placeholders** — nothing real is hardcoded. Fill the two CONFIG nodes after import.\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `RUN_STARTED` → `DATA_FETCHED` → `SUMMARY_GENERATED` → `REPORT_SENT` (or `REPORT_FAILED` on empty data)",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 4940,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7437d775-6616-4e08-83af-65fc64bf127d",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Monday trigger + config\nWeekly Schedule Trigger (Mon 08:00) fires → CONFIG — Report holds client name, sheet ID, client email, Telegram chat ID, brand color → run logged to Sheets with stage `RUN_STARTED`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "91e962cc-ba61-47b6-bc91-ba172d7acca3",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Pull ad data from 3 platforms\nCONFIG — API Access holds every token/ID as PASTE_YOUR_* placeholders → three HTTP requests run in parallel: Meta Graph API insights (spend, clicks, impressions), Google Ads GAQL (cost, clicks, conversions), GA4 Data API (conversions, revenue). Bearer tokens come from the config, never hardcoded.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fcd68f5a-bf79-4b61-a643-2e14de070766",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — Blend + sanity check\nMerge nodes combine the three API responses → IF — Any Data? verifies at least one platform returned rows. Empty data takes the failure branch: logs `REPORT_FAILED` and still notifies you on Telegram.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ad2810b2-cfd5-4dcc-8eb4-66565f48c00e",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1480,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — Totals + AI summary\nCompute Totals blends everything into total spend, clicks, impressions, conversions, revenue, ROAS, CTR, CPA → sheet flips to `DATA_FETCHED` → AI Agent (gpt-4o-mini + Structured Output Parser) writes standout_metric, risk, recommendation, summary → sheet flips to `SUMMARY_GENERATED`.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "54af7545-8758-433d-a1b8-b3fcf6e9e81e",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2160,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 5 — Report + delivery\nBuild Report HTML assembles the branded email → sheet flips to `REPORT_SENT` → Gmail sends it to the client → Telegram — Run Digest posts totals + the AI take to the agency.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 1440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8d94eabf-54dc-4f6a-9947-7aa09c5bcb64",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2900,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FAILURE BRANCH\nIf all three APIs return nothing (expired token, wrong IDs), the run still logs `REPORT_FAILED` to Sheets and posts a failure alert to Telegram — a silent miss never happens.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "20dd99d8-eeab-43f9-b128-7e96e5193c83",
      "name": "STICKY — FAILURE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        440
      ]
    },
